# physics-residual-aqa

Do Newtonian flight-phase invariants, computed from monocular pose,
carry measurable signal about diving execution quality?

## Status
Work in progress. No results yet.

## Hypotheses
- H0 (gate): the angular-momentum residual is reliably measurable
  from broadcast 2D pose
- H1: physics residuals improve prediction of difficulty-normalised
  execution score over a matched pose-only baseline
- H2: the advantage grows as labelled data shrinks

## Data
MTL-AQA (Parmar & Morris, CVPR 2019). Labels from the authors' repo;
videos downloaded from the YouTube links they provide. Not redistributed here.

## Not yet verified
Everything. Results will be added only as experiments actually run.
